  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting COVID Response in the Greater Mekong Sub-region through Health Systems Strengthening</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme will provide support on strengthening heath systems in the Greater Mekong Subregion (GMS) to prevent, detect and control the threat of COVID-19. The programme will work in Cambodia, Laos, Myanmar and Vietnam and will also involve Thailand in regional initiatives.</narrative>
  </description>
